  "tagline": "The configuration panel of the EH3D server, in the look of BUNGARD-GUI.",
  "description": "EH3D-STUDIO is a web application in React and TypeScript. It signs in to EH3D-SERVER and shows and changes what the server holds, in three groups of pages: Monitor (the overview, the machines by station, the jobs and the live events), Configure (the machines with their node and their configuration files, the users and the tokens, the settings of the server) and Account. Each person sees the pages their role allows. The client of the API, the rules of the forms and the eight languages are tested; the pages have been looked at in a browser against a local server with simulated machines.",
